 "title": "Al Asalah Home Finance | Shariah-Compliant Housing Solution | The Saudi Investment Bank",
 "text": "Skip to main content\nMain nav - Personal\nAccounts\nTravel Account\nALASALAH Current Account\nSalary Account\nMurabaha Deposit\nTime Deposits\nALBARAKAH Saving Account\nFinance\nAl Asalah Personal Finance\nAlasalah Home Finance\nE-Banking\nInternet Banking (Flexx Click)\nPhone Banking (Flexx Call)\nFlexx Transfer\nATM/Cash Deposit Service\nSAIB Mobile Apps\nPayments & Transfers\nCustomers Programs\nSilver Program\nGold Program\nPlatinum Program\nPrivate Banking\nCards\nMada Debit Cards\nTravel Card\nPre-Paid Cards\nCredit Cards\nOffers & Services\nEasy Payment Plans\nLoyalty Programs\nAseel Loyalty Program\nWooW Reward Program\nMain nav - Bottom\nCustomer Service\nAbout Us\nPrices of financing & savings products\nCommunity Investment\nFinancial Consumer Protection Principles & Rules\nInvestor Relations\nOpen Banking\nعربي\nMENU\n\nFinancing & Savings Rates\n\nعربي\nLOGIN\nBreadcrumb\nPersonal Banking\nFinance\nAl Asalah Home Finance\nAlasalah Home Finance\nAl Asalah Murabaha Home Finance\n\nExperience the ease of Murabaha, where the bank purchases the property on your behalf, providing a fixed profit rate for the entire financing period, whether it's a completed villa, apartment, duplex, or urban land ready for occupancy, ALASALAH has you covered.\n\nLEARN MORE >\nHome Finance Programs In Cooperation With REDF\n\nA variety of home finance programs tailored to meet diverse needs whether you're building your dream home from scratch, seeking to leverage the equity in your existing property, or investing in off-plan developments.\n\nLEARN MORE >\nHome Equity\n\nA product that enables the customer who owns a property (Villa or Apartment and Land) to obtain financial liquidity against the property and pledge the property as collateral to The Saudi Investment Bank with easy repayment options.\n\nLEARN MORE >\nPersonal Banking\nAccounts\nCustomers Programs\nFinance\nCards\nE-Banking Services\nLoyalty Programs\nTreasury and Investment Group\nLiquidity Management\nForeign Exchange\nStructured products\nInvestment Department\nFinancial institutions\nStrategic Investments\nCorporate Banking\nSmall and Medium Enterprises\nCash Management and Payroll Services\nTrade Finance Solutions\nValue Added Tax (VAT)\nCommunity Investment\nOur Approach to Sustainabality\nEnvironmental Policy\nSustainability Committee Charter\nStakeholders\nFinancing of Environmental Friendly Projects\nBanking Awareness\nWoow Al Khair\nSustainability Reports\nSTAKEHOLDERS\nUseful links\nLetter of Guarantee Services\nValue Added Tax (VAT)\nBanking Tariff\nSAIB Forms\nThe Saudi Credit Bureau (SIMAH)\nBayan Credit Bureau\nIBAN Converter\nBudget Calculator\nFinancial Consumer Protection Principles and Rules\nAbout Us\nCareers\nPrices of financing & savings products\n\nDownload the app\n\n \nPrivacy Notice |Cookie Policy |Locate a Branch |Customer Service |Media Center\n\n© Copyright The Saudi Investment Bank 2026 | Terms and Conditions\n\nThe Saudi Investment Bank, a Saudi joint-stock company with a paid-up capital of   12,500,000,000 (12.5 billion ), registered under CRN 1010011570 and Unified Number 7000029889. Its registered address is P.O. Box 3533, Riyadh 11481, Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, with a national address at Sheikh Abdulrahman bin Hassan Street, Al-Ma’ather District, Unit No. 2, Riyadh 8081. For inquiries, please contact us at +966 11 4778433 or visit our website at www.saib.com.sa. The bank is licensed by and subject to the supervision and control of the Saudi Central Bank under Royal Decree No. M/31 dated 25/06/1396 H.",
